  "notes": "USAGE: {等分|とうぶん} is used for dividing things (food, money, lines) into exactly equal portions.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- Xを{等分|とうぶん}する (to divide X equally)\n- Xを{二|に}/{三|さん}/{四|よん}{等分|とうぶん}する (to divide X into 2/3/4 equal parts)\n- {等分|とうぶん}に{分|わ}ける (to divide equally)\n\nNOTE: Often used with numbers to specify how many parts ({二等分|にとうぶん}, {三等分|さんとうぶん}, etc.).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {均等|きんとう} - equal, even (more abstract)\n- {半分|はんぶん} - half (specifically two parts)",
